# Force textual diffs for source files. UTF-8 content (e.g. `§`, em-dashes in
# CatalogService.kt) can trip git's binary-detection heuristic and get shown as
# "Binary files ... differ" in diffs. `text` normalizes line endings; `diff`
# forces git to treat the file as text so diffs stay readable.
*.kt   text diff
*.kts  text diff
